    "name": "Extra Case: My Girlfriend's Secrets",
    "steam_appid": 1959530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your girlfriend seems to be hiding something. Will you respect her privacy or pry into her secrets? Don't worry, though. This is a horror dating sim with a time loop, so you can try again...and again...and again... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/3168227c21fd3053a68ac0e31dbf3ac0.avif?t=1754624913\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sarah &quot;Sally&quot; Sweet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your girlfriend who you recently got into a relationship with. She seems to be hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Don't ever, EVER \u2014 open the door to my room.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Good boys get 'rewarded' at night.&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/fe54b0d38b47343529457bd2e640b4d2.avif?t=1754624913\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You / Marty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A male college student. You're dating your first ever girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;If she doesn't want to talk about it, I'm not going to ask. She's entitled to her privacy, after all.&quot;</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I told you not to open the door to my room!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're invited to your girlfriend's house, but you see something you shouldn't see in her room, and then get attacked by someone... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/dbd5e83235ee2041ddca7f701e76aacd.poster.avif?t=1754624913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/dbd5e83235ee2041ddca7f701e76aacd.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/dbd5e83235ee2041ddca7f701e76aacd.mp4?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rewind time to avoid tragedy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, you somehow get the ability to rewind time. Using it is the only way to avoid tragedy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.poster.avif?t=1754624913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.mp4?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate items to unlock options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning, the choices you can make are limited. But by investigating items and advancing the plot, you can unlock options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce464662327364cf9095a6acf7f63584.poster.avif?t=1754624913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce464662327364cf9095a6acf7f63584.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce464662327364cf9095a6acf7f63584.mp4?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Piece together the truth with ten endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has ten endings, each revealing one of your girlfriend's secrets. The only way to piece together the truth she hides is to connect those secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guidelines for Streams and Let's Plays</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are happy to have you stream our games or upload Let's Plays of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also monetize that gameplay, but only by using the features on online video platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We would appreciate it if you would include the game name in the stream or Let's Play title, or put the Steam page link in the description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We take no responsibility for any damage caused by your streams or Let's Plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game uses character sprite materials from &quot;\u308f\u305f\u304a\u304d\u3070&quot; [Wataokiba], which can be used for commercial purposes under their terms of use.</p>",
