13\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/dbd5e83235ee2041ddca7f701e76aacd.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/dbd5e83235ee2041ddca7f701e76aacd.mp4?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rewind time to avoid tragedy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, you somehow get the ability to rewind time. Using it is the only way to avoid tragedy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.poster.avif?t=1754624913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/2b9c4a92b5e773392b3c4110f0d2c05d.mp4?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate items to unlock options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the beginning, the choices you can make are limited. But by investigating items and advancing the plot, you can unlock options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce464662327364cf9095a6acf7f63584.poster.avif?t=1754624913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce464662327364cf9095a6acf7f63584.webm?t=1754624913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959530/extras/ce46466232736